        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your brain with this clever rabbit puzzle game full of strategy and charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, you’ll guide a group of bunnies as they hop over each other into a single hole — but their jumps are limited, so every move must be planned with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use logic and timing to create the perfect chain of hops. Think it’s simple? Think again! The world is alive with obstacles and helpers — squirrels, tree barks, and water lilies offer moving rides across ponds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is a test of wit and planning, with fun mechanics that grow as you play. Whether you’re hopping past hazards or using nature to your advantage, each level offers a new challenge to solve. Perfect for fans of thoughtful, grid-based puzzles with a fresh twist!</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Test your brain with this clever rabbit puzzle game full of strategy and charm!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In each level, you’ll guide a group of bunnies as they hop over each other into a single hole — but their jumps are limited, so every move must be planned with care.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use logic and timing to create the perfect chain of hops. Think it’s simple? Think again! The world is alive with obstacles and helpers — squirrels, tree barks, and water lilies offer moving rides across ponds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is a test of wit and planning, with fun mechanics that grow as you play. Whether you’re hopping past hazards or using nature to your advantage, each level offers a new challenge to solve. Perfect for fans of thoughtful, grid-based puzzles with a fresh twist!</p>",
        "short_description": "Guide clever rabbits into one hole using smart hops and limited moves. Plan each jump carefully — squirrels, logs, and lily pads add fun twists! Use obstacles wisely to solve unique puzzles that blend logic, timing, and strategy.",
        "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese",
